# API
- batch requests
- CreateWindow background pixmap refers to Pixmap without additional enum values like relative.
- Separate type for masks
- If decoding allocates one dynamic field and then a later field fails, generated decode functions do not appear to have errdefer cleanu  p for partially decoded values.

## Fixed array should use just copy

```
pub const KeymapNotifyEvent = struct {
    keys: [31]u8,

    pub fn decode(reader: *std.Io.Reader) DecodeError!@This() {
        var result: @This() = undefined;
        for (&result.keys) |*elem| {
            elem.* = try reader.takeByte();
        }
        return result;
    }
};
```
